        "Let us execute our unified 3D Spatial Collision & Raycast Engine in code. In our simulator, we command the engine to perform a mouse click pick against a populated scene containing dynamic avatars and environment obstacles. We trace the broad-phase culling of distant objects and the narrow-phase triangle intersection of the selected avatar, confirming complete operational readiness."
