      "output": "[AR Spatial Invariant] Point Cloud Acquired: 100 SLAM feature points\n[RANSAC Plane Detection] Fitted Plane: Normal=[-0.01, -1, -0.001], D=0.748\n[Surface Classification] Type: HORIZONTAL_UPWARD | Inliers: 100/100 (100% confidence)\n[WebXR Hit-Test Result] Ray Pierces Table at: [0, 0.749, -0.851] m\n[XRAnchor Invariant] Drift-compensated persistent spatial anchor bound to physical table surface!"
