      "output": "[Bilateral Invariant] Edge-Preserving Bilateral Depth-Aware Blur Online\nPixel 1 (Interior Flat Surface): Raw=0.42 -> Filtered=0.402 | Edge Rejected: true (Smooth Denoise)\nPixel 2 (Foreground Edge): Raw=0.4 -> Filtered=0.403 | Edge Rejected: true (Zero Bleed from 12m Wall!)\nPixel 3 (Background Edge): Raw=0.88 -> Filtered=0.898 | Edge Rejected: true (Zero Bleed from 2m Character!)\n[Silhouette Invariant] Bilateral depth weights strictly prevent cross-silhouette color contamination!"
