        "We have arrived at the summit: the 5-Gate Grand Master Viva Voce Architecture Defense and final certification of our 30-Day 3D Computer Graphics Curriculum. Over thirty intensive days, you have mastered the mathematics, physics, shader programming, and systems engineering that power the world most advanced real-time rendering engines.",
