        "This cooperative caching pattern demonstrates the power of co-designing spatial data structures with modern SIMD hardware. Rather than treating memory access as an afterthought, every step of the spatial grid build\u2014from hashing and radix sorting to offset indexing and neighbor iteration\u2014is sculpted around GPU memory hierarchy strengths.",
